-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Haunted Manor</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">🍬250</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.93.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n<i><big>\"A dyeable candle that's smol, short, and perfect for ambience.\"</big></i>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Small Candle</b> is part of the candle series of items sold at the Monstrous Manor for the 2025 Halloween event. It can be bought at the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor\" title=\"The Monstrous Manor\">Monstrous Manor</a> or from <a href=\"/wiki/Halloween_Popper\" title=\"Halloween Popper\">Halloween Poppers</a>. This version has about the same width as the <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Candle\" title=\"Tall Candle\">tall candle</a> but shorter.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This item (like all the other candles) can be dyed.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>When interacted with, it can be lit up with [F]</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Candles can be placed in candle holder or fancy candle holders</li></ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"e76bbd474c003ba200d2358c7c63c16b\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:110px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Candlelit-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:108px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Candlelit.png\" title=\"Candlelit.png (5.86 MB)\" style=\"height:108px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/77/Candlelit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251006033141\" title=\"Candlelit.png (5.86 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"When interacted, candle has a flame\" height=\"108\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Candlelit.png\" data-image-key=\"Candlelit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"&lt;i&gt;When interacted, candle has a flame&lt;/i&gt;\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Candlelit.png (5.86 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"When interacted, candle has a flame\" height=\"108\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Candlelit.png\" data-image-key=\"Candlelit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"&lt;i&gt;When interacted, candle has a flame&lt;/i&gt;\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/77/Candlelit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251006033141\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbo